OL,3,GNEWSA'Louby Lou' shares reality of life
OL,4,Aas a clown
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor almost three decades, Lucy
OL,7,FWilkinson has dedicated her life to
OL,8,Fmaking children laugh as a professional
OL,9,Fclown.
OL,11,FLucy, better known as "Louby Lou", said
OL,12,Fher passion for clown life began when
OL,13,Fshe started helping her father Arnold
OL,14,FCheetham, aka Trumble the Clown, at
OL,15,Flocal shows as a child.
OL,17,F"I fell in love with the laughter, joy
OL,18,Fand magic that came from entertaining
OL,19,Fkids," she said. "It was back then that
OL,20,FI knew this was my calling."
